# Breach
tile.chaosshard.breach_altar.name=Breach Altar
item.chaosshard.veil_shard.name=Veil Shard
item.chaosshard.memory_fragment.name=Memory Fragment
item.chaosshard.memory_page.name=Memory Page: "Breach"
item.chaosshard.breach_book.name=Book of Breach
chaosshard.veil_shard.lore=A sliver of the barrier Luchezaria hides behind. It rings if you hold it to your ear.
chaosshard.memory_fragment.lore=A scrap of the Lord's memory, stuck in a foreign world. Warm to the touch.
chaosshard.memory_page.lore=A restored memory: how to slip through the Veil.
chaosshard.breach_book.lore=A way through the Veil, written in the Lord's hand.
chaosshard.breach_book.use1=First time — RMB on the Breach Altar
chaosshard.breach_book.use2=Then RMB — travel between the Antechamber and Luchezaria
chaosshard.breach_book.sealed=The book is silent. Perform the ritual at the Breach Altar first.
chaosshard.breach.need_book=The altar needs the Book of Breach in hand
chaosshard.breach.not_here=Grimoire: A breach is only possible from the Antechamber. The Veil is too far from here.
chaosshard.breach.thin=Grimoire: The Thread is too thin — the Lord can't reach. Level %s needed.
chaosshard.breach.no_sky=Grimoire: The altar needs open sky above it. How else would we aim at the Veil?
chaosshard.breach.no_pillars=Grimoire: Missing pillars. Diagonally from the altar, one block gap — four pillars: chaos stone below, crust on top.
chaosshard.breach.start=Grimoire: Here we go. Stay close and hold still — break the ritual and we start over.
chaosshard.breach.step1=Grimoire: Feel the Thread pull? That's the Lord reaching for the Veil. With your hands.
chaosshard.breach.step2=Grimoire: The Veil has noticed us. It doesn't like it. We do.
chaosshard.breach.lord=Death: Go, my Shard. This world will be mine.
chaosshard.breach.broken=Grimoire: The ritual broke. Well. Start again.
chaosshard.breach.lord_done=Death: You are through. Take this world.
chaosshard.breach.done=Grimoire: We're in Luchezaria! Sun, grass, villagers... ugh. The book is open now: RMB takes you home to the Antechamber and back.
chaosshard.spell.recall.sealed=The Veil is closed. Breach it first.
chaosshard.config.breach=Breach

